<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish First National Building Soc cuts rates.</title>
<headline>Irish First National Building Soc cuts rates.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's First National Building Society on Thursday announced that it was reducing interest rates with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The building society said in a statement that it had reduced both its discount variable rate and its one-year fixed rate to 5.95 percent from 6.25 percent respectively.</p>
<p>The building society reduced its two-year fixed rate to 6.75 percent from 7.15 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 97756</p>
</text>
